%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Noto Sans SC, Microsoft YaHei, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, SimHei, Arial, sans-serif'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant OT as OrderTable/ModifyDialog
    participant APP as App Handler
    participant API as ApiService
    participant BE as Orders Router
    participant SVC as BloombergEMSXService
    participant EMSX as Bloomberg EMSX

    Note over U,EMSX: T0 用户点击 Modify 并确认

    U->>OT: 编辑字段并提交
    activate OT

    alt 前端校验失败
        OT-->>U: 显示校验错误(数量/价格/止损等)
    else 校验通过
        OT->>APP: onModifyOrder(orderId, updates)
        activate APP
        APP->>API: modifyOrder(request)
        activate API
        API->>BE: POST /api/orders/modify
        activate BE

        BE->>SVC: modify_order(逐字段)
        activate SVC
        loop 每个待修改字段
            SVC->>EMSX: ModifyOrderEx
            activate EMSX
            EMSX-->>SVC: 字段修改结果
            deactivate EMSX
        end

        alt 任一字段失败
            SVC-->>BE: error detail
            BE-->>API: 4xx/5xx
            API-->>APP: 失败
            APP-->>OT: toast error
        else 全部成功
            SVC-->>BE: success
            BE-->>API: ApiResponse(success)
            API-->>APP: success
            APP-->>OT: toast success
            Note over APP: T1 触发二次刷新
            APP->>API: fetchOrders()
            API->>BE: GET /api/orders + /api/routes
            BE-->>API: 最新订单/路由
            API-->>APP: refreshed data
        end

        deactivate SVC
        deactivate BE
        deactivate API
        deactivate APP
    end

    deactivate OT
    Note over U,EMSX: T2 UI 与后端状态一致